---
/**
 * `<Hook>` … `</Hook>` — ≤120 words plus one figure or explorable
 * (docs/CONTENT_AUTHORING.md §4). No heading: it reads as a lede block with
 * a left hairline; `id="hook"` keeps it in the outline rail.
 */
---

<section id="hook" class="hook" aria-label="Hook">
  <slot />
</section>

<style>
  .hook {
    margin-block: 1.5em 2em;
    padding-inline-start: 1.25rem;
    border-inline-start: 2px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 1.0625em;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .hook > :global(:first-child) {
    margin-block-start: 0;
  }
  .hook > :global(:last-child) {
    margin-block-end: 0;
  }
</style>
